\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Family-level DQN--MPC-4 evidence in the synthetic soft-constrained benchmark. (a) Six DQN objectives and MPC-4 are evaluated in 20 paired model-seed blocks, each averaging 20 shared held-out traces. (b) Cells report the mean episode-cost difference, DQN minus MPC-4, for all 30 objective--regime contrasts; negative values favor DQN. (c) Circles and lines show the largest, least-favorable mean difference within each scope and its 95\% joint-bootstrap interval; open triangles show simultaneous 95\% upper bounds. A single 10,000-resample seed-block bootstrap preserves correlation among the 30 contrasts. Exact two-sided sign tests are Holm-adjusted across all 30 comparisons, all of which satisfy the prespecified support rule. \textbf  {中文：}合成软约束基准中的 DQN 家族相对 MPC-4 的证据。（a）六种 DQN 目标与 MPC-4 在 20 个配对模型种子区组中评估，每个区组对 20 条共享留出轨迹取平均。（b）单元格给出全部 30 个“目标—工况”对比的平均回合成本差，即 DQN 减 MPC-4；负值有利于 DQN。（c）圆点和线段表示各范围内最大、即最不利的均值差及其 95\% 联合 bootstrap 区间；空心三角形表示同时单侧 95\% 上界。一次包含 10,000 次重采样的种子区组 bootstrap 保留 30 个对比之间的相关性。精确双侧符号检验在全部 30 个比较上进行 Holm 校正，且所有比较均满足预设支持规则。\relax }}{1}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
\providecommand*\caption@xref[2]{\@setref\relax\@undefined{#1}}
\newlabel{fig:graphical}{{1}{1}{Family-level DQN--MPC-4 evidence in the synthetic soft-constrained benchmark. (a) Six DQN objectives and MPC-4 are evaluated in 20 paired model-seed blocks, each averaging 20 shared held-out traces. (b) Cells report the mean episode-cost difference, DQN minus MPC-4, for all 30 objective--regime contrasts; negative values favor DQN. (c) Circles and lines show the largest, least-favorable mean difference within each scope and its 95\% joint-bootstrap interval; open triangles show simultaneous 95\% upper bounds. A single 10,000-resample seed-block bootstrap preserves correlation among the 30 contrasts. Exact two-sided sign tests are Holm-adjusted across all 30 comparisons, all of which satisfy the prespecified support rule.\\\textbf {中文：}合成软约束基准中的 DQN 家族相对 MPC-4 的证据。（a）六种 DQN 目标与 MPC-4 在 20 个配对模型种子区组中评估，每个区组对 20 条共享留出轨迹取平均。（b）单元格给出全部 30 个“目标—工况”对比的平均回合成本差，即 DQN 减 MPC-4；负值有利于 DQN。（c）圆点和线段表示各范围内最大、即最不利的均值差及其 95\% 联合 bootstrap 区间；空心三角形表示同时单侧 95\% 上界。一次包含 10,000 次重采样的种子区组 bootstrap 保留 30 个对比之间的相关性。精确双侧符号检验在全部 30 个比较上进行 Holm 校正，且所有比较均满足预设支持规则。\relax }{figure.caption.1}{}}
