\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Positioning of training-time modeled-action supervision used by four objectives in the evaluated DQN family. “All actions” means that one learning update can use modeled outcomes for every discrete action at the sampled state. Standard DQN and Double DQN provide factual-only family controls. \textbf  {中文：}本文所评估 DQN 家族中四种目标所用训练时模型化动作监督的定位。“全部动作”表示一次学习更新能够使用采样状态下每个离散动作的模型化结果；标准 DQN 和 Double DQN 提供仅使用事实转移的家族对照。\relax }}{3}{table.caption.2}\protected@file@percent }
