\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Training-only centered full-action mechanism. The upper path retains the factual standard-DQN target and Huber loss. The lower path previews all three actions, constructs three Bellman targets, centers them within state, and distills their relative advantages. Both losses update the online Q-network; the target network is synchronized only at the shared fixed interval. Preview outputs are unavailable during evaluation and deployment. \textbf  {中文：}仅用于训练的中心化全动作机制。上方路径保留事实标准 DQN 目标与 Huber 损失；下方路径预览三个动作，构造三个 Bellman 目标，在状态内对其中心化，并蒸馏相对优势。两个损失共同更新在线 Q 网络；目标网络仅按共享的固定间隔同步。评估和部署期间无法使用预览输出。\relax }}{9}{figure.caption.7}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:mechanism}{{4}{9}{Training-only centered full-action mechanism. The upper path retains the factual standard-DQN target and Huber loss. The lower path previews all three actions, constructs three Bellman targets, centers them within state, and distills their relative advantages. Both losses update the online Q-network; the target network is synchronized only at the shared fixed interval. Preview outputs are unavailable during evaluation and deployment.\\\textbf {中文：}仅用于训练的中心化全动作机制。上方路径保留事实标准 DQN 目标与 Huber 损失；下方路径预览三个动作，构造三个 Bellman 目标，在状态内对其中心化，并蒸馏相对优势。两个损失共同更新在线 Q 网络；目标网络仅按共享的固定间隔同步。评估和部署期间无法使用预览输出。\relax }{figure.caption.7}{}}
